(40369, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Ah, what a lovely haul this is! Look at these samples! Fascinating! Wait... What\'s this? Ah, it seems you have found yourself a small companion! Perhaps you should study its behaviour before you decide on your favourite seasoning.', 0);
